{"tutorial":{"title":"把问题变成可执行的请求","summary":"清楚交代背景、目标、限制和输出，再用示例和验收标准减少误解。好的问题让合作形成下一步可执行的动作。","scenes":[{"title":"好问题让合作更容易","seconds":15,"narration":"当别人不知道你的背景和目标，就只能猜。把问题说清楚，是帮助对方给出有用答案，不是把话写得更复杂。","points":["减少猜测","增加有用信息"],"visual":{"kind":"flow","labels":["你的处境","清楚的请求","可执行答案"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"当别人不知道你的背景和目标","startMs":120,"endMs":2950,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"就只能猜","startMs":2950,"endMs":3961,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"把问题说清楚","startMs":3961,"endMs":5377,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"是帮助对方给出有用答案","startMs":5377,"endMs":7803,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"不是把话写得更复杂","startMs":7803,"endMs":9824,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/clear-questions/01.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"从一个模糊请求开始","seconds":15,"narration":"例如“帮我做个课程”。这句话缺少受众、主题、时长和结果，十个人可能理解成十种完全不同的任务。","points":["缺少关键条件"],"visual":{"kind":"compare","labels":["帮我做课程","受众、主题、时长？"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"例如“帮我做个课程”","startMs":120,"endMs":2350,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"这句话缺少受众、主题、时长和结果","startMs":2350,"endMs":5797,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"十个人可能理解成十种完全不同的任务","startMs":5797,"endMs":9447,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/clear-questions/02.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"先交代当前背景","seconds":15,"narration":"说明自己处于什么情境。比如要给初学者介绍水循环，明天课堂使用，让对方知道这个请求从哪里来。","points":["情境","已有条件"],"visual":{"kind":"flow","labels":["初学者课堂","水循环主题","明天使用"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"说明自己处于什么情境","startMs":120,"endMs":2414,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"比如要给初学者介绍水循环","startMs":2414,"endMs":5124,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"明天课堂使用","startMs":5124,"endMs":6583,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"让对方知道这个请求从哪里来","startMs":6583,"endMs":9503,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/clear-questions/03.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"目标用结果来描述","seconds":15,"narration":"不要只说“做好一点”。说明希望学员能解释水循环三步，能判断云为什么不是水蒸气，这样就能判断是否达到目标。","points":["可观察的学习结果"],"visual":{"kind":"flow","labels":["解释三步","判断误区","检验目标"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"不要只说“做好一点”","startMs":120,"endMs":2335,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"说明希望学员能解释水循环三步","startMs":2335,"endMs":5355,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"能判断云为什么不是水蒸气","startMs":5355,"endMs":7973,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"这样就能判断是否达到目标","startMs":7973,"endMs":10591,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/clear-questions/04.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"受众决定讲到多深","seconds":15,"narration":"初学者需要常见词和图解，专业读者可能需要更多条件和细节。告诉对方受众，避免难度和表达方式不匹配。","points":["初学者与专业者不同"],"visual":{"kind":"compare","labels":["初学者：基础图解","专业者：条件细节"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"初学者需要常见词和图解","startMs":120,"endMs":2698,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"专业读者可能需要更多条件和细节","startMs":2698,"endMs":6135,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"告诉对方受众","startMs":6135,"endMs":7639,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"避免难度和表达方式不匹配","startMs":7639,"endMs":10431,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/clear-questions/05.wav","audioVoice":"kokoro-zh-zf_021-s0.93-v1"},{"title":"把时间限制说具体","seconds":15,"narration":"用“三分钟教程”比“短一点”清楚。说明截止时间和教程时长是两件事，分别写，避免被混为一谈。","points":["作品时长","交付时间"],"visual":{"kind":"compare","labels":["时长：3分钟","交付：明天下午"],"values":[],"note":""},"captions":[{"text":"用“三分钟教程”比“短一点”清楚","startMs":120,"endMs":3503,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"说明截止时间和教程时长是两件事","startMs":3503,"endMs":6687,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"分别写","startMs":6687,"endMs":7482,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null},{"text":"避免被混为一谈","startMs":7482,"endMs":9075,"timestampMs":null,"confidence":null}],"audio":"/course/animations/clear-questions